  {
    "title": "b, d, f, m, n, p, s, t, z sound as in English",
    "body": "These letters are close to English. s is always the “s” of “sun”, never “z”, and z is always “z”. Every letter is said: Turkish has no silent letters.",
    "pattern": "[bdfmnpstz]",
