  {
    "title": "mi, mı, mu, mü turn a sentence into a yes/no question",
    "body": "The question particle is written as a separate word and follows vowel harmony, but it is never stressed. The voice rises on the syllable just before it: var mı? is “VAHR muh?”.",
    "pattern": "(?<!\\p{L})m[iıuü](?:s[ıiuü]n(?:[ıiuü]z)?|y[ıiuü]m|y[ıiuü]z|d[ıiuü]r)?(?!\\p{L})",
